---
// 랜딩 — 레이아웃 골격만. 인터랙션은 다음 단계에서 [data-*] 훅에 붙인다.
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Placeholder from '../components/Placeholder.astro';
import { ROUTES, url } from '../lib/site';

const sections = ROUTES.filter((r) => r.key !== 'home');
---

<Base route="home">
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-type">
      <h1 class="t-display" data-hero-title>A Better<br />You<span class="bar" aria-hidden="true"></span></h1>
      <p class="t-label hero-sub">
        <span class="t-muted">Track</span> / Reflect / Build / Repeat
      </p>
    </div>

    <aside class="hero-side">
      <dl class="spec t-label">
        <dt>Side A</dt><dd>A more focused you</dd>
        <dt>Side B</dt><dd>A brighter tomorrow</dd>
        <dt>Type</dt><dd>Personal enhancement</dd>
      </dl>
      <a class="cta" href={url('/portfolio')} data-cta>
        <span class="t-label">Play<br />A better you</span>
        <span class="t-label cta-right">Press for<br />progress <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span></span>
      </a>
    </aside>
  </section>

  <section class="cards">
    {sections.map((r, i) => (
      <a class:list={['card', { 'card--ink': i === 0 }]} href={url(r.path)} data-card>
        <span class="t-label">{r.no}</span>
        <Placeholder ratio="16/9" label={r.ko} tone={i === 0 ? 'ink' : 'paper'} />
        <span class="t-title">{r.label}</span>
        <span class="t-label">{r.sub}</span>
      </a>
    ))}
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .hero {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(var(--cols), minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 2rem;
    padding: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 5rem) var(--gutter);
  }
  .hero-type { grid-column: 1 / span 7; display: grid; gap: 2rem; align-content: start; }
  .bar {
    display: inline-block;
    width: 1.1em;
    height: 0.07em;
    margin-left: 0.3em;
    vertical-align: middle;
    background: currentColor;
  }
  .hero-sub { font-size: var(--fs-lead); letter-spacing: 0.25em; }

  .hero-side { grid-column: 8 / -1; display: grid; align-content: start; border-left: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .spec {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 6em 1fr;
    gap: 0.6rem 1rem;
    padding: 2rem;
  }
  .cta {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    min-height: 10rem;
    padding: 2rem;
    background: var(--red);
    color: var(--white);
  }
  .arrow { display: inline-block; font-size: 1.5rem; margin-left: 1rem; transition: transform var(--dur) var(--ease-out); }
  .cta:hover .arrow { transform: translateX(0.5rem); }

  .cards {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    margin: 0 var(--gutter) clamp(2rem, 6vw, 5rem);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .card {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border-left: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .card:first-child { border-left: 0; }
  .card--ink { background: var(--ink); color: var(--white); }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .hero-type, .hero-side { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
    .hero-side { border-left: 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
    .cards { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .card { border-left: 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
    .card:first-child { border-top: 0; }
  }
</style>
